Z||000000||Zorba||12-21-2000||01:56 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/122alnkit.jpg"> <P>Pro Street Coil-Over Conversion System<BR>A complete system, put together for the do-it-yourselfer, to convert <B>any car</B> equipped with stock shocks and springs to a coil-over suspension. ALN kits include two Aluma Matic shocks and DR kits include two Proma Star shocks. Both kits include variable rate coil springs, upper crossmember, mounting tabs, mounts and hardware. <B>$434.99 and no 4-8 weeks of waiting for the darn order!</B><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Will||12-21-2000||10:13 AM||||It won't work on the back without a LOT of fabrication and engineering. It could work on the front, but likewise would take a good bit of engineering.<BR>     It looks like it's designed for dragsters (Pro-Street) with 4 link rear suspension.<BR>     You'd have better luck trying to adapt the rice-boy coil overs for an eclipse or something similar--something that uses struts.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||VISCERAL||12-21-2000||10:52 AM||||Go here. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.ground-control.com/gcapguid.htm" TARGET=_blank>www.ground-control.com/gcapguid.htm</A>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/co_gen.jpg"> <P>I got mine from these guys. Its a good deal for just the rear. I would probably go with a 275lb spring rating though. Gst some kyb adjustables struts. My 350lb is too stiff unless you put in a v8   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>1987 Fiero GT: silver, 5 spd, centerforce dual friction clutch, Koni's all around, coilovers in the rear, lowered 2" - susp.tech, poly bushings-control arms-sway bars-cradle-motor, rear sway bar, pioneer cd player, 180 stat, 176-166 fan switch, Rodney Dickman's short shifter, bushings, etc..., grand am brakes all around, k&n filter, next year V-8 + lowered spindles + 17x8 and 17x9" Mas Italy wheels +  235/45/17 and 255/40/17's + new paint + Mr. Mikes leather interior + 11.25" brakes w/ parking brake.<p>[This message has been edited by VISCERAL (edited 12-21-2000).]||||reg||14
